The learned counsel for the Appellant relied upon the decisions of the National Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission, New Delhi ("NCDRC") in the cases of M/S International Corporation v. Export Credit Guarantee Corporation of India Ltd. [First Appeal No. 596 of 2012];
M/S Galundia Textiles Pvt. Ltd. v. E.C.G.C. Ltd. [First Appeal No. 2015 of 2017] and ECGC of India Ltd. v. Blossom Grocery & Foods India Pvt. Ltd. [First Appeal No. 2344 of 2019], which have interpreted the terms of the policies issued by the Appellant that are similar to Part III Clause 3(b)
of the Policy.
